{
  "_comment": [
    "Managed console logins (PEI-1187). peinit pins /dev/console to the kernel's concrete serial endpoint or tty1; tty0 never follows later VT switches.",
    "login-console has precedence 10, so the duplicate login-tty1 is skipped when the primary console is local. OOBE has precedence 100 and retains the primary console first.",
    "All instances use login --console to wait until both OOBE definitions retire and reset terminal input before prompting. Additional consoles never attempt autologon. Missing local VTs are skipped.",
    "Each session is independently supervised and restarted after logout. The primary console retains the live-medium passwordless-account attempt. Installing this seed alone is inert until the edition applies it."
  ],
  "keys": [
    {"path": "Machine\\System"},
    {"path": "Machine\\System\\Services"},
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Services\\login-console",
      "values": [
        {"name": "ImagePath", "type": "sz", "data": "/bin/login"},
        {"name": "Arguments", "type": "multi", "data": ["--console", "--try-no-password", "peios"]},
        {"name": "TTYPath", "type": "sz", "data": "/dev/console"},
        {"name": "Triggers", "type": "multi", "data": ["boot:settled", "tty:released"]},
        {"name": "Requires", "type": "multi", "data": ["lpsd"]},
        {"name": "Identity", "type": "sz", "data": "SYSTEM"},
        {"name": "RequiredPrivileges", "type": "multi", "data": ["SeChangeNotifyPrivilege", "SeAssignPrimaryTokenPrivilege", "SeTcbPrivilege"]},
        {"name": "Readiness", "type": "dword", "data": 1},
        {"name": "RestartPolicy", "type": "dword", "data": 2},
        {"name": "ErrorControl", "type": "dword", "data": 0},
        {"name": "DisplayName", "type": "sz", "data": "Console login"},
        {"name": "Description", "type": "sz", "data": "Terminal logon prompt on the system console"},
        {"name": "TTYPrecedence", "type": "dword", "data": 10}
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Services\\login-tty1",
      "values": [
        {"name": "ImagePath", "type": "sz", "data": "/bin/login"},
        {"name": "Arguments", "type": "multi", "data": ["--console"]},
        {"name": "TTYPath", "type": "sz", "data": "/dev/tty1"},
        {"name": "Triggers", "type": "multi", "data": ["boot:settled"]},
        {"name": "Requires", "type": "multi", "data": ["lpsd"]},
        {"name": "Identity", "type": "sz", "data": "SYSTEM"},
        {"name": "RequiredPrivileges", "type": "multi", "data": ["SeChangeNotifyPrivilege", "SeAssignPrimaryTokenPrivilege", "SeTcbPrivilege"]},
        {"name": "Readiness", "type": "dword", "data": 1},
        {"name": "RestartPolicy", "type": "dword", "data": 2},
        {"name": "ErrorControl", "type": "dword", "data": 0},
        {"name": "DisplayName", "type": "sz", "data": "Console 1 login"},
        {"name": "Description", "type": "sz", "data": "Authenticated local login on tty1"},
        {"name": "TTYPrecedence", "type": "dword", "data": 0},
        {"name": "Conditions", "type": "multi", "data": ["path:/dev/tty1"]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Services\\login-tty2",
      "values": [
